+        "Each item states something in absolute terms (always/never/without exception or the equivalent in the "
+        "instructional language).\n"
+        "For each item decide ONE of:\n"
+        '  keep    - the claim is genuinely exceptionless as stated, in the stated scope\n'
+        '  rescope - the claim is a tendency or has real exceptions: rewrite it in the SAME instructional '
+        "language with accurate scope, keeping every correct fact and every example reference intact\n"
+        '  correct - the claim contradicts the supplied same-page evidence or is factually wrong: rewrite it '
+        "minimally so it is true\n"
+        "Rules: never add new rules, vocabulary, examples or facts; never change the instructional language; "
+        "never lengthen a claim by more than about 30 percent; when unsure, prefer rescope over keep.\n"
+        'Return ONLY: {"verdicts":[{"id":0,"action":"keep|rescope|correct","value":"replacement text or null"}]}'
+    )
